# Caddy configuration lives in config/caddy/.
#
#   config/caddy/Caddyfile                          — global config (deploy to /etc/caddy/Caddyfile)
#   config/caddy/snippets/*.conf                     — reusable snippets, one per file
#                                                       (deploy to /etc/caddy/snippets/, imported
#                                                       by the global Caddyfile)
#   config/caddy/sites/staging.left-wordle.com      — staging site include
#   config/caddy/sites/production.left-wordle.com   — production site include
#
# Site includes are synced automatically by `cap <stage> deploy` (see
# lib/capistrano/tasks/caddy.rake and each stage's caddy_site_source /
# caddy_site_live_path) -- config/caddy/sites is the source of truth for
# those, no manual server-side patching needed.
#
# The global Caddyfile and its snippets are NOT auto-deployed -- they're
# shared by every site on paula-poundstone (not just left-wordle), so
# changes there are applied by hand deliberately (validate, then reload)
# after checking what else runs on the box. Keep these two files in sync
# with whatever's actually live after a manual change.
